       <div class="ch"><h1>Common-Emitter Amplifier</h1><div class="ch-card"><h2>Circuit</h2><ul><li><strong>R1, R2:</strong> voltage divider that biases the base</li><li><strong>RC, RE:</strong> collector and emitter resistors set the gain</li><li><strong>C1, C2:</strong> coupling capacitors, <strong>CE:</strong> emitter bypass</li><li><strong>V2:</strong> 10 mV, 1 kHz input; <strong>V1:</strong> 12 V supply</li></ul></div><div class="ch-formula">Gain ≈ - RC / re (inverting)</div></div>
    </div>
